    "required": [
      "at"
    ],
    "description": "Splits a clip (`item`), or several (`items`), into two at a timeline time that lies strictly\ninside each (`Invalid{path:\"/at\"}` at or beyond the edges). The halves are contiguous:\ndurations sum to the original and the right half's `source_in` continues where the left\nhalf ends. Linked partners are split too, and children attached at or after the time move\nto the right half. `at` is snapped to the sequence's frame grid (`fine: true`: the audio\nsample grid, for audio clips not linked to video). `Locked` if a track involved is locked.",
    "title": "ClipSplit"
  },
